 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tire",
   "text": "The left front tire has a low tread depth of 5/32nd, and others are worn with tread depths of 3/32nd to 4/32nd. The wheels have some curb rashes."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The washer fluid level is low. The vehicle's exterior was dusty during inspection, which can hide minor imperfections. However, there are still minor miscellaneous scratches around the vehicle. These scratches are normal for the vehicle's mileage, and most of them are too small to see in photos. There are scratches on the hood, front bumper, rear bumper, and left fenders. The left side panels have multiple dents, including the rear fender, door, rocker panel, and hood edge. Refer to pictures 15, 26, 27, and 55. There is some general misalignment of the left side body panels. The right front fender has prior paint. The left mirror housing is cracked at the base. Refer to pictures 16 and 20. The front bumper and grille have some cracks and are misaligned. Refer to pictures 22, 23, and 24. The exterior lights were functional and working properly. The sunroof also worked well."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The dash has a small, heavy scratch above the glove box. Refer to picture 61. I did not notice any odd smells or signs that the car had been smoked in. There were also no signs of water leaks. The climate control system operated in all modes and blew the desired temperature. All the interior electronics appeared to operate as designed."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The underside has some wetness. I'm unable to determine if this is due to a leak, as no parts are being removed from the vehicle. Refer to picture 91. All accessible fluids are on level. It did not have any visible active fluid leaks at the time of inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The vehicle starts up with no issues or unusual sounds. The steering alignment is straight, and engine performance is good. The vehicle shifts through all gears with no issues. The brakes are firm with no pulsations or grinding. I scanned the vehicle's system, and no error codes were found."
  }
 ],
